 "build": {
  "id": "687811f2-5314-47a6-b19c-153d3019a071",
  "title": "Sun Cleric - General Build",
  "description": "[overview]\nI am using this while leveling.  It has been effective in PvE, PvP, and open world PvP/leveling.  Only level 36 but enemies die in 1-3 hits.  Need to juggle vows for mana regeneration but mana is not really an issue.\n\nAlways tops charts in aoe dungeon pulls, while still performing well in ST.  \n\nIn PvP can quickly delete backline squishies if you can avoid getting CCed to death.\n\nProbably not the best and will adjust as I continue to level, but so far this has been extremely viable.\n\n[macros]\nI macroed my main damage abilities to include\n/startattack which allows me to just spam my normal attacks and not worry about right-clicking in the middle of a fight.",
  "class_id": 27,
  "spec_id": 90,
